           SSTATE_NOT_INTERNED (0)
           SSTATE_INTERNED_MORTAL (1)
           SSTATE_INTERNED_IMMORTAL (2)

           If interned != SSTATE_NOT_INTERNED, the two references from the
           dictionary to this object are *not* counted in ob_refcnt.
